Ye Tune Kya Kiya Guitar Chords easy lesson from Bollywood Hindi movie Once Upon A Time In Mumbai Dobara sung by Javed Bashir.

[G]Ishaq Ki.. [D]Sazishein,        [G]Ishaq Ki.. [D]Baziyan
[G]Hara Main [D]Khel Ke,        [G]Do Dilo [D]Ka Juaa

[C]Kyun Tune Meri Fursat [G]Ki,        [C]Kyun Dil Mein Itni Harqat [G]Ki
[C]Ishaq Mein Itni Barqat [G]Ki,        [D]Ye Tune Kya [G]Kiya…

[C]Phiru Ab Mara Mara [G]Main,        [C]Chaand Se Bichda Tara [G]Main
[C]Dil Se Itna Kyun Hara [G]Main,        [D]Ye Tune Kya [G]Kiya…

[G]Saari Duniya Se [D]Jeet Ke Main,        [C]Aaya Hoon [D]Idhar
[G]Tere Aage Hi Main [D]Hara Kiya,        [C]Tune Kya [D]Asar

[C]Main Dil Ka Raaz Kehta [G]Hoon,        [C]Ke Jab Jab Sansein Leta [G]Hoon
[C]Tera Hi Naam Leta [G]Hoon,        [D]Ye Tune Kya [G]Kiya…

