[G]Meri Bahon Ko Teri Sanson Ki Jo,        [D]Adatein Lagi Hain Waise
[C]Jee Leta Hoon Ab Main Thoda [D]Aur

[G]Meri Dil Ki Ret Pe Ankhon Ki Jo,        [D]Pade Parchai Teri
[C]Pee Leta Hoon Tab Main Thoda [D]Aur

[G]Jaane Kaun Hai Tu [D]Meri,        [C]Main Naa Janu Ye [D]Magar
[G]Jahaan Jaaun Main [D]Karun,        [C]Main Wahan Tera Hi [D]Zikar

[C]Mujhe Tu Razi Lagti [G]Hai,        [C]Jeeti Hui Bazi Lagti [G]Hai
[C]Tabiyat Tazi Lagti [G]Hai,        [D]Ye Tune Kya [G]Kiya

