[G]Kyun Khud Ko Main Barbad Karoon,        [D]Fanaa Hoke Tujhse Miloon
[C]Ishaq Ka Ajab Hai [D]Qaayda

[G]Teri Raahon Se Jo [D]Guzri,        [C]Hain Meri [D]Dagar
